     "source": "Skarda et al., npj Comput. Mater. 8, 78 (2022), author PDF https://web.stanford.edu/group/nqp/jv_files/papers/jinhie_distrib.pdf, p.4: \"a 30 μm × 30 μm metalens with focal-length 20 μm designed from the low aspect-ratio scatterer library used in Fig. 3b\", \"In 35 optimization iterations, the metalens efficiency is almost doubled.\" p.3, Fig. 3b caption: \"silicon cylinders with height 220 nm ... background refractive index 1.66; source wavelength of 1340 nm\"",
